Yim's Riced ROM Project
========================

YRRP is a LineageOS 23.2 derivative targeting OnePlus 11 (`salami`). This manifest keeps LineageOS as upstream baseline and routes only modified projects to YRRP forks.

Getting started
---------------

Initialize source from YRRP manifest:

```
repo init -u https://github.com/YRRPs/android.git -b lineage-23.2 --git-lfs
```

Sync source:

```
repo sync
```

Load build environment and bootstrap device dependencies:

```
source build/envsetup.sh
breakfast salami
```

LineageOS roomservice manages unmodified device, kernel, and hardware projects. YRRP manifest currently replaces only `frameworks/base` with [`YRRPs/android_frameworks_base`](https://github.com/YRRPs/android_frameworks_base).

Build, signing, installation, and project documentation live in [`YRRPs/project`](https://github.com/YRRPs/project).

Upstream
--------

YRRP derives from [LineageOS](https://github.com/LineageOS). Follow [LineageOS Wiki](https://wiki.lineageos.org/) for device build fundamentals and submit generally useful upstream changes through [LineageOS Gerrit](https://review.lineageos.org/).
